{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29557","headline":"独居有怀 · 李商隐","name":"独居有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麝重愁风逼，罗疎畏月侵。\n怨魂迷恐断，娇喘细疑沈。\n数急芙蓉带，频抽翡翠簪。\n柔情终不远，遥妬已先深。\n浦冷鸳鸯去，园空蛱蝶寻。\n蜡花长递泪，筝柱镇移心。\n觅使嵩云暮，回头灞岸阴。\n只闻凉叶院，露井近寒砧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}